<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review - USDA -Nov 15.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review - USDA -Nov 15.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Services.</p>
<p>Prices as of November 22, 1996</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mostly steady to 5 cents lower.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was steady to 13.00 higher, mostly steady.</p>
<p>Crude Sunflower Oil was 3 to 75 points lower.</p>
